msgctxt "332"
msgid "Do you want to fish here?"
msgstr "¿Quiere pescar aquí?"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
#. y4:msg_role=name
#. y4:msg_name_id=0
msgctxt "4192"
msgid "Player"
msgstr "Player"

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:msg_role=name
#. y4:msg_name_id=1
msgctxt "4196"
msgid "Fishing"
msgstr "Pesca"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "344_Player"
msgid "(Let's do some fishing.)"
msgstr "(Hora de pescar un poco.)"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "368_Player"
msgid "(On second thought... Maybe not.)"
msgstr "(Pensándolo bien... quizá no)."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "380_Fishing"
msgid "Select your bait, then decide where to cast your line.\\r\n\\r\nEach type of bait has a different range of effect, and the fish won't bite if you use the wrong bait. Items in your possession that can be used as bait will be shown in a list."
msgstr "Seleccione su cebo, después, decida donde lanzar el sedal.\\r\n\\r\nCada tipo de cebo tiene un rango de efecto diferente, y \\r\nlos peces no pican si se usa el cebo incorrecto. Los \\r\nobjetos en su posesión que se puedan usar de cebo se \\r\nle mostrarán en una lista."

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "392_Fishing"
msgid "\\r\nThe gauge shows where fish are most concentrated. Use bait that is effective in those areas."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "404_Fishing"
msgid "Cast your line and wait for a fish to bite.\\r\n\\r\nThe <Action:Button_Cross@Fishing> icon will appear when a fish is biting. Quickly press <Action:Button_Cross@Fishing> and reel the line in."
msgstr "Lance el sedal y espere a que un pez muerda el anzuelo.\\r\n\\r\nEl ícono <Action:Button_Cross@Fishing> aparecerá cuando un pez pique. \\r\nPresione rápidamente <Action:Button_Cross@Fishing> y recoja el sedal."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "416_Fishing"
msgid "<Action:Button_R1@Fishing> reels in, while <Action:Button_L1@Fishing> adds slack. Pay attention to the Tension Gauge, and don't let the fish snap your line. Use <Action:Button_LS_Left@Fishing><Action:Button_LS_Right@Fishing>, following the movement of the fish. Move it up and down to raise or lower the pole."
msgstr "<Action:Button_R1@Fishing> enrolla, mientras que <Action:Button_L1@Fishing> suelta. Preste atención al indicador de tensión y no deje que los peces rompan el sedal. Mueva<Action:Button_LS_Left@Fishing><Action:Button_LS_Right@Fishing> siguiendo el movimiento del pez. Mueva arriba y abajo \\r\npara subir o bajar la caña."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "428_Fishing"
msgid "If you control the line's tension and completely reel it in, you will successfully catch the fish."
msgstr "Si controla la tensión del sedal y lo trae entero, \\r\ncapturará el pescado con éxito."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "440_Player"
msgid "(I bet there are lots of fish over there...)"
msgstr "(Apuesto a que hay muchos peces por allí...)"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "464_Player"
msgid "(All right, let's get the bait ready. This is what I've got with me...)"
msgstr "(Muy bien, a preparar el cebo. Esto es lo que llevo encima...)"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "476_Player"
msgid "(I should review the instructions.)"
msgstr "(Debería repasar las instrucciones.)"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "488_Player"
msgid "(Maybe later.)"
msgstr "(Tal vez más tarde)."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "500_Player"
msgid "(I didn't get a bite...)"
msgstr "(Nada mordió el anzuelo...)"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "512_Player"
msgid "(My timing was off...)"
msgstr "(Se me fue la mano...)"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "524_Player"
msgid "(The line broke...)"
msgstr "(Se rompió el sedal...)"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "536_Player"
msgid "(The fish got away...)"
msgstr "(El pez se escapó...)"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "560_Player"
msgid "(I need to put new bait on.)"
msgstr "(Necesito poner cebo nuevo.)"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "572_Player"
msgid "(That's enough for now.)"
msgstr "(Es suficiente por ahora.)"

